Z||000000||BroCar 87||08-23-2000||11:13 PM||||Hey ROBERT, I got my car back last week, and got set to look for nice fiero's. Today I saw a sweet (stock but sweet) GT. At first, it looked as if he had some kind of tail light mod done. So I was like  WHOOOAAA! He was in the turn lane and I was in the far lane. So as he was making a u-turn, I made my way over. I saw him park at the bank so... I HUALED @$$ and caught up to him and parked next to him. We conversated for about 5 minutes and awwwed at each others FIERO'S, then were off. <BR>I gave him my # and the FORUM CARD. I also gave him the north fl fiero club addy. on the back of the card.<BR>By the way, His name is KEN WOOD... drives a white GT (stock) but sweet, couldn't see anything wrong with it except a very small seat tear.   (but who doesn't get those??)<P>Well I did my little part today and felt sooooooooooo GREAT!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/NorthFLFieroSIG.jpg">  <BR>87 Coupe "IRON BEAST"<BR>84 SE (project)||||reg||6
